      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "## Tips\n- Use the Management Zone filter, to retrieve the worker nodes related to a specific application.\n- Use the dynamic filter, below the title, to select a Kubernetes cluster, namespace, or workload.\n\n### Understanding the table\n- Each row represents a Kubernetes workload and the numbers are different metrics related to it. \n- You should pay attention when both coloured cells are red."
